OL,3,AFed has 'work to do' if price rises
OL,4,Adon't ease for Americans, Warsh says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new Fed boss stressed that his
OL,7,Fremarks should not be treated as a
OL,8,Fguide for future interest rate
OL,9,Fdecisions, but the comments suggest
OL,10,Frates could be raised if policymakers
OL,11,Fbelieve inflation is too high.
OL,13,FThe latest figures showed prices rose
OL,14,F3.4% in the year to July, above the
OL,15,FFed's 2% target.
